<title>USA: HFS Inc to double ERA real estate offices.</title>
<headline>HFS Inc to double ERA real estate offices.</headline>
<dateline>PARSIPPANY, N.J. 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>HFS Inc said Friday that during the next five years it will double the number of offices of its real estate franchise subsidiary, ERA Franchise Systems Inc.</p>
<p>The company said it presently has 1,200 Franchise Systems offices and master franchise agreements in 19 countries. Expansion would give Franchise Systems a total of 2,500 offices in Europe, South America, Africa and Asia in the next five years, HFS said.</p>
</text>
